{
  "key": "global.living_plan",
  "kind": "living_plan",
  "jurisdiction": "GLOBAL",
  "version": 1,
  "legal": false,
  "languages": [
    "fr",
    "ar",
    "en"
  ],
  "origin": "Yosr's living plan (branch roommate-matching, 2026-10-16), rebuilt from the household's own data (D-115)",
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "household",
      "type": "text",
      "from": "household",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "name": "start_date",
      "type": "date",
      "from": "user",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "name": "habits",
      "type": "items",
      "from": "household",
      "required": true,
      "max": 6,
      "columns": [
        "topic",
        "agreement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "costs",
      "type": "items",
      "from": "household",
      "required": false,
      "max": 20,
      "columns": [
        "label",
        "amount",
        "due_day",
        "share"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "chores",
      "type": "items",
      "from": "household",
      "required": false,
      "max": 30,
      "columns": [
        "title",
        "frequency",
        "next"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rules",
      "type": "items",
      "from": "household",
      "required": false,
      "max": 30,
      "columns": [
        "category",
        "text"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "notes",
      "type": "text",
      "from": "user",
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "sources": [],
  "text": {
    "fr": {
      "title": "Plan de vie commune",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Plan de vie commune du foyer {{household}}.",
        "Ce plan s'applique à partir du {{start_date}}.",
        "Habitudes de chacun : ce qui est déjà d'accord et ce qui reste à discuter (sans dire qui a répondu quoi).",
        "{{habits}}",
        "Loyer et factures, avec la part de chacun à parts égales sauf accord différent :",
        "{{costs}}",
        "Tâches et tours :",
        "{{chores}}",
        "Règles de la maison :",
        "{{rules}}",
        "Remarques : {{notes}}"
      ]
    },
    "ar": {
      "title": "خطة العيش المشترك",
      "paragraphs": [
        "خطة العيش المشترك لمسكن {{household}}.",
        "تُطبّق هذه الخطة ابتداء من {{start_date}}.",
        "عادات كل واحد: ما تم الاتفاق عليه وما يبقى للنقاش (دون ذكر من أجاب بماذا).",
        "{{habits}}",
        "الإيجار والفواتير، مع حصة كل واحد بالتساوي ما لم يُتفق على غير ذلك:",
        "{{costs}}",
        "المهام والأدوار:",
        "{{chores}}",
        "قواعد المنزل:",
        "{{rules}}",
        "ملاحظات: {{notes}}"
      ]
    },
    "en": {
      "title": "Living plan",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Living plan of the household {{household}}.",
        "This plan applies from {{start_date}}.",
        "How each person lives: what is already agreed and what is left to discuss (without saying who answered what).",
        "{{habits}}",
        "Rent and bills, with each person's share in equal parts unless agreed otherwise:",
        "{{costs}}",
        "Chores and turns:",
        "{{chores}}",
        "House rules:",
        "{{rules}}",
        "Notes: {{notes}}"
      ]
    }
  }
}
